         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">In this lab, we believe: science is real (microscope image), love is love (rainbow anatomical heart), black lives matter (brown raised fist), feminism is for everyone (female symbol), cells are cool (cells), immigrants are welcome (statue of liberty).</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
